      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Maybe we should skip setting labels if label is empty here?\n\nWhat if a user sets a label on an object to something non-empty and then later set the label back to empty? Setting the label back to empty will be skipped and that\u0027s potentially confusing.\n\nI\u0027m equally happy to abandon this CL FWIW. I don\u0027t think what the code now is doing is wrong it\u0027s just a bit unexpected.",
